{"title":"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A group of librarians were asked to choose between a mystery or a fantasy book. The results are shown in the circle graph.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people chose mystery, how many people chose fantasy?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Official_Solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Official_Solution)\">Solution 1 (Official Solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Official Solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that the number of people that choose fantasy is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/0/da0194a23dc5d5afae8e9ded7e850a654a958886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{75\\%}{25\\%} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"72\" height=\"41\" /> times the number of people that choose mystery. \n</p><p>Because the number of people that chose mystery was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the number of people that chose fantasy was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/4/5c457831026b02751542db722ee01c49463a8536.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\times 3 = \\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher and CEMC\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of people that were asked to choose between the two.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of those people chose mystery, which was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/f/f0f03b81f8ad6815266a9e6a92555078bfbabccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\times 25\\% = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/b/35b590647c22f528a5fe78250294b2b95700f844.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{4} = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/e/83ee2c1f971440c802c86c67c3cca9db3852210e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 12 \\times 4 = 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afbad0b221f0ef70186fe70b08e6fc1efdd8dfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people were asked the question altogether and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people chose mystery, the number of people that chose fantasy was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8a31c85ea6462adb4002fa8fe42220325649e98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48 - 12 = \\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC\">2024 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a hre